    "body": "## Summary\n\nComfyUI's MiniMax H3 PackedLayout signature uses the patch-padded latent height and width. The SGLang adapter compared those values to the original unpadded video tensor, so a 5x7 latent was rejected as stale even though its serialized layout correctly described the padded 6x8 grid. With fl2va keyframes, rejecting the layout raises `NotImplementedError` because the fallback cannot reconstruct ComfyUI keyframe positions.\n\nThis change compares the signature against height and width rounded up to the 2x2 patch size and adds a regression test with an odd 5x7 target and keyframe latent.\n\n## Validation\n\n- The production signature helper accepts the 5x7 -> 6x8 layout; the prior unpadded comparison rejects it.\n- Changed Python files compile with Python 3.12; `git diff --check` passes.\n- The full pytest case could not run in this environment: Python 3.9 is below this checkout's syntax requirements, while Python 3.12 does not have pytest or PyTorch installed.\n- GPU end-to-end validation was unavailable because this machine has no NVIDIA runtime/device.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37974364385](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37974364385)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37974364047](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37974364047)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37974364378](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37974364378)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
